 "verdict": "partly consistent: 75 signs = 75 letters, 19 groups = 19 words; breaks in the hook Hk (ق in قولك, القهوة; ل in هل) and the plain e-loop Ep (ف in فيمن, د in دنياه); ت has two shapes (ᔕ in ظفرت, ayn-hook in يغتنم)",
 "notes": "Rows 66v l.11-13 (image 0084_0137) and 67r l.1-2 (image 0084_0138): 14 + 16 + 15 + 15 + 15 = 75, as the record; يحجم runs over the line end. Plain 1x line crops (66v x 150-1600) and 1.5-2x zooms. The =H sign is ha / ta marbuta at word end every time (9), < alif (11), the U-loop mim (7), ^ with a dot ya (6), H nun (4); the sin-teeth-on-a-loop sign is غ in both يغتنم and يغشاه. The e-loops: the three with an inner tick are all ف; the two without it are ف (فيمن) and د (دنياه), kept as one shape; if the tick is not a real difference the e-loop is ف x4, د x1. ت in ظفرت is partly under the tear at the left end of l.11. Record transcription confirmed letter for letter."
